I had the same problem syncing three M-Audio Delta 1010LTs. The Delta 
1010LT can sync via dedicated word clock or S/PDIF, but neither option 
seemed to work under envy24control. Jaroslav released a patch for 
envy24control on this list (message dated 19 Feb 2004) to add the "word 
clock" option for Delta 1010LT - maybe the Terratec needs something similar?

Unfortunately I still couldn't sync the cards with the patched version 
(no word clock or S/PDIF syncing).

Ludwig


